Step 2: Monitoring with AWS CloudWatch AWS CloudWatch is a monitoring and management service that provides data and actionable insights for AWS, hybrid, and on-premises applications.
Configure Caddy to Log to CloudWatch: Modify your Caddy configuration to log directly to CloudWatch Logs. You can use the AWS CLI or SDKs to push logs to CloudWatch. import os
